    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    cml:operator "Prohibit" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Reckless failure to make or alter an accounting document is prohibited." ;
    cml:premiseText "(b) the person is reckless as to whether the making, alteration, destruction or concealment of the document (or the failure to make or alter the document) facilitates, conceals or disguises..." ;
